# MAREA ROJA — make.fun gta6-01 entry

[![make.fun · gta6-01](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01)
[![rank](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/AhCheng91/ahcheng91-gta6-01/rank.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01/leaderboard)
[![reward](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/AhCheng91/ahcheng91-gta6-01/reward.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01)

MAREA ROJA is an original open-world crime game set in Puerto Marea, a made-up Caribbean port city of pastel Art-Deco waterfronts, container cranes, night markets and palm boulevards. Play as wheelman Rafa Quintero: explore on foot, steal and drive cars through live traffic, and work your way through a crew's jobs while the city's police force closes in.

## Run it

Serve the static files with Node 22 or newer:

```sh
node serve.ts
```

Then open `http://localhost:8080` in desktop Chrome. Click the game once to capture the mouse. WASD moves or drives, the mouse looks around, Space handbrakes in a car, and F gets in or out of a nearby vehicle. The game runs entirely offline from `game/`.
